1
00:00:00,599 --> 00:00:04,560
Yeah… so…

2
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:11,120
- Do you have class tomorrow?
- Yes, I do. In the morning.

3
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:15,519
- And in the afternoon?
- Well…

4
00:00:15,519 --> 00:00:19,199
I'm free, but I don't know if my friends
are going anywhere.

5
00:00:19,199 --> 00:00:25,039
You really can't think for yourself?
Just follow your friends in everything?

6
00:00:25,039 --> 00:00:30,119
I just don't know what to do.
Being with my friends means I'm not lonely.

7
00:00:30,119 --> 00:00:35,239
So being with me makes you lonely?

8
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:47,840
Tomorrow you're not going anywhere.
I'm not letting you go out.

9
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:54,240
After class, come straight home.
Got it? Hey!

10
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:15,560
- Earth, you wanna go bowling with me?
- Are you talking to me?

11
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:21,240
- Well yeah, who else would I talk to?
- I'm not going.

12
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:25,600
Mm.

13
00:01:32,119 --> 00:01:37,720
- Being a good boy?
- No.
